<section class="relative my-16 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-amber-500/30 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#181511] via-[#12100d] to-[#0a0908] p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-2xl shadow-amber-950/20">
  <!-- Subtle decorative vinyl lines -->
  <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-80 h-80 rounded-full border border-amber-500/10 pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-60 h-60 rounded-full border border-amber-500/10 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/20">
      <span>📬 Publicación Semanal Gratuita</span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-100 tracking-tight leading-tight">
      Las historias que <span class="text-amber-400 italic">no caben</span> en un minuto de video.
    </h2>

    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed font-sans max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Suscríbete gratis a nuestra correspondencia en Substack. Recibe cada semana un ensayo musicológico completo, fotografías inéditas de archivo y el rigor documental de los grandes enigmas del pop y el rock.
    </p>

    <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="https://acordesocultos.substack.com"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold tracking-wide uppercase bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-600 text-black shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-amber-500 transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 text-center"
      >
        Suscribirse en Substack
      </a>
      <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">100% libre de spam. Cancela en cualquier momento.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
